[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6901.669, "timestamp": "01:55:01", "text": "就像我们没有增加墓地一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6903.669, "timestamp": "01:55:03", "text": "现在。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6905.35, "timestamp": "01:55:05", "text": "但我们已经有三个冷却时间了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6906.95, "timestamp": "01:55:06", "text": "现在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6910.39, "timestamp": "01:55:10", "text": "是啊，但是如果真是这样，那就不好玩了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6912.47, "timestamp": "01:55:12", "text": "不用担心物品丢失，是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6915.27, "timestamp": "01:55:15", "text": "哦，是的。没错，没错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6917.35, "timestamp": "01:55:17", "text": "这个游戏还是我的世界吗？是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6921.109, "timestamp": "01:55:21", "text": "是。呃，是飞机，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6923.43, "timestamp": "01:55:23", "text": "东西，飞机之类的东西正在使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6926.87, "timestamp": "01:55:26", "text": "手工制品。就是这样。是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6928.709, "timestamp": "01:55:28", "text": "我就知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6931.03, "timestamp": "01:55:31", "text": "不过，这些手工材料真的太棒了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6934.95, "timestamp": "01:55:34", "text": "希望我们能像添加机械一样添加它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6936.87, "timestamp": "01:55:36", "text": "等等，我们可以把它加进去吗？你觉得是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6948.709, "timestamp": "01:55:48", "text": "行动？我打算全身心投入其中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6951.189, "timestamp": "01:55:51", "text": "哦，等等。你可以创作艺术绘画作品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6954.39, "timestamp": "01:55:54", "text": "等等，我们应该添加一些绘画作品。艺术品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6956.47, "timestamp": "01:55:56", "text": "涂鸦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6958.229, "timestamp": "01:55:58", "text": "你可以添加任何你想要的内容。你有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6959.51, "timestamp": "01:55:59", "text": "是游戏机吧？它将"}]